# Project context

- Decentraland SDK7 reference lives under `/dclcontext` and via `cursor.config`.
- **Scaling UI:** before creating or editing any `Layer` / zone UI, read and follow `.cursor/skills/scaling-ui/SKILL.md`.
- Hard rules: one Layer = one Zone; implement `body()` only; forward size/align/chrome through `uiTransform` and `uiBackground` only — never Layer shorthands (`backgroundColor`, `borderRadius`, …) or re-mount `ScreenInsetArea`/`ZoneRoot`/`Zone` in `render()`.
